@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> InputPreferences : User inputs dietary preferences, allergies, health goals

InputPreferences --> GeneratePlan : System generates personalized meal plan

GeneratePlan --> DisplayPlan : Display meal plan to user

DisplayPlan --> TrackProgress : User tracks progress and adjusts plan as needed

TrackProgress --> AccessPlan : Access meal plan from any device

AccessPlan --> CustomizePlan : Customize meal plan

CustomizePlan --> FinalState : Final state

FinalState --> [*]

@enduml
